      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    original_loan_amount = 15000\n    monthly_payment = 700\n    original_payments = 24\n    payments_made = 10\n    remaining_payments = original_payments - payments_made\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_finance_charge = (\n        original_payments * monthly_payment\n    ) - original_loan_amount\n\n    unearned_interest = total_finance_charge * (\n        remaining_payments * (remaining_payments + 1)\n    ) / (\n        original_payments * (original_payments + 1)\n    )\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to the nearest dollar\n    return round(unearned_interest)\n```",
